WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:06.270
We entered into Gaito's lair and managed to save Noelle, the Indigo Mermaid Princess,

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:10.290
and Coco, the Yellow Mermaid Princess.

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:15.760
Suddenly, Gaito appeared and trapped me in a mirror.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:20.510
Gaito threatened to keep me trapped alone forever, but everyone came to my rescue.

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.860
The bad part is that our songs don't work against Gaito.

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:12.710
W-Why...

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:15.950
Our song didn't work against Gaito!?

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:20.950
It doesn't matter how much you sing, with only your six pearls.

00:02:20.950 --> 00:02:24.890
You can't win against me as long you're missing the final pearl.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:30.360
Mermaid Princesses, have a taste of my hatred!

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:43.440
Hippo!

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:44.450
Are you alright?

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:45.110
Hippo!

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.130
I'm alright.

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:50.550
Don't mind me, everyone be on your guard.

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:53.890
The rest of you are next.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.010
Resurrected Truth.

00:03:01.590 --> 00:03:04.830
Watch out, Lucia!

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:10.740
Gaito!

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.920
What amazing power.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.750
It seems that his powers have increased again.

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:15.610
Yeah.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.330
Everyone, be careful!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.180
Yeah.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.490
That symbol!

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:34.430
Do you know something about the symbol that appeared on Gaito's forehead?

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:40.790
That's the same symbol that appeared on Kaito's forehead once before.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:41.720
Huh!?

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:42.770
What did you say!?

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.540
You're right.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.840
Kaito is my long lost younger brother.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.250
How can that be...

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.720
How can Kaito be your younger brother?

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:55.510
Kaito has already returned to my side.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.810
Now, the power of the Panterassa can finally materialize completely.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:04.160
Even if I don't have your seven pearls, something like destroying the land is a simple task for me.

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.290
Stop it!

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.860
I won't let you do that!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:10.190
It doesn't matter what you say.

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:13.980
There's only one path for you to choose.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:19.860
If you treasure your lives, hand over your pearls quietly, get on your knees, and beg for forgiveness.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.500
No, I don't believe you!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:32.390
Even if Kaito really is your younger brother, Kaito will always be my Kaito!

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:34.850
He will definitely not join you!

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:37.150
If this is the case, then I have another path to choose!

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:42.160
Alright, Mermaid Princesses.

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:46.060
I will show you what happens if you defy me.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:50.000
Let the winds blow and the waves crash!

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.930
Let lightning shine!

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:56.510
And engulf the lands in a sea of despair!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.910
Oh, winds! Oh, waves!

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.040
Destroy with even more fury!

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:35.980
Stop it!

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.820
She's right. Stop it now!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:42.820
I'll let my lovely underlings deal with you.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:48.630
We're your opponents.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:49.880
Prepare yourselves.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:51.230
We'll clobber all of you.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:54.270
I won't let even one finger touch Gaito-sama.

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:56.270
Now, eat this!

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.240
Super Lovers Ice Darts!

00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:02.940
Their powers have increased!

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:06.280
It's not the same Ice Darts from before.

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:09.610
We've been powered-up with Gaito-sama's power.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.120
Yoo-hoo!

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.200
There's still more to come!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.310
Eat this!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:19.820
Go, water dragon!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:24.990
I'll join in too!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.670
What a nice show, Mermaid Princesses!

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.960
Everyone, this way!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.850
We can take cover and hide over here!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.200
I won't let you escape!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:47.180
Super Lovers Ice Darts!

00:06:48.290 --> 00:06:49.020
Lucia!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.990
Kaito, save me!

00:06:55.070 --> 00:06:56.390
Kaito!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:02.330
LUCIA!!!!!

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:07.620
What!? This light is...

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:11.210
That bastard. He dares to interfere with me...

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:14.550
T-This light is...

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.640
Kaito has...

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:19.090
Kaito has saved me once again!

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:21.460
Too bright...

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:30.760
Lucia-san!

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:31.860
Lucia!

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:33.530
Thanks goodness you're safe.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:35.200
But what happened?

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:38.190
Yeah, what was that light?

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.860
We need to save Kaito!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:44.570
We have to save him now, before his heart is devoured by Gaito!

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:46.110
If we don't, it'll be too late!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:46.880
Lucia.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:51.180
When I was enveloped by that light, I heard Kaito's voice.

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.450
Lucia!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:57.690
I could clearly hear Kaito calling out my name.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:02.320
But Kaito has already fallen into Gaito's hands.

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:05.640
Yeah, his heart is probably controlled by Gaito already.

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:07.300
No.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:11.100
Even if he's being controlled, Kaito's heart is still alive!

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:15.810
You're...

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.910
...The Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.580
Sara!

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:21.250
Oh yeah, Sara!

00:08:21.250 --> 00:08:24.170
You know where Kaito is, right!?

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:24.780
Tell me!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.120
Foolish Mermaid Princesses.

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:29.490
Come to your senses quickly.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.890
Don't be misled by love.

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:34.470
You should abandon your love before he betrays you.

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:36.460
That would be the right choice.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.000
I beg you, Sara!

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.550
If you won't tell us, I'll have to use force to make you!

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:44.240
How interesting.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:47.510
Then I shall have you use force to make me say it.

00:08:47.510 --> 00:08:50.100
I'm not afraid since my friends are with me.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:53.510
I will make you understand the power of love once again!

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.160
Pichi Pichi Voice, Live Start!

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:41.320
Are your abilities only this strong?

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:42.990
Sara.

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.290
Our songs don't affect Sara, either?

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:47.710
Fools.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:53.230
Did you think the songs you received from Aqua Regina would work on me, a Mermaid Princess?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:58.680
I will show you Mermaid Princesses that love is nothing but an empty word!

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.510
It hurts...

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:16.280
I can't breathe...

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:17.320
No!

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.160
Sara, stop it!

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:29.060
Suffer in pain! Struggle for your lives!

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:34.000
This is nothing compared to the pain I've suffered!

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.440
K-Kaito...

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.150
Does it hurt?

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:05.540
Serves you right.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.080
I will let you feel even more pain!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:10.640
A piano...

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:13.420
Tarou-chan is playing the piano...

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:14.970
Mitsuki.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:27.060
Mitsuki! Stop playing the piano!

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:35.740
Mitsuki!

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:37.890
I said to stop playing the piano!

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:38.970
Can't you hear me!?

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:50.000
Tarou-chan... so you were alright.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.420
Thank goodness.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.850
I understand, Mitsuki.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:01.760
You're saying that you no longer cherish your life, right?

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.730
Then, I shall grant your wish!

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:08.230
No!

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.040
You surprised me.

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.540
The pain should have made you fall to your knees.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:18.610
Stop hurting Tarou-chan right now!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:23.080
If you can't relieve your anger, then take it out on me!

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.260
How interesting.

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:28.090
I wonder how long you can put up this facade.

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.340
It hurts...

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.150
But if I give in, Tarou-chan will be...

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.300
I don't want that to happen!

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:52.310
Why...

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:54.520
Why would you sacrifice so much for him?

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.150
Such honest eyes...

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:59.280
She's just like me in the past.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.090
No! I'm going to remember...

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.240
Tarou!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.300
Were you surprised?

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:11.160
Geez!

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:13.050
Wait!

00:14:14.820 --> 00:14:15.670
Sara!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:17.550
Tarou!

00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:23.740
Sara.

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:29.410
Sara...

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:42.830
Sara, are you shedding tears for Tarou-chan?

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:24.070
Sara's song changed...

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:26.000
Yeah, what happened to her?

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:35.370
Sara.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:39.440
Sara.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.110
Mitsuki.

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:47.390
Tarou-chan...

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:52.060
Tarou!

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:52.960
Tarou-chan!

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.620
Tarou, hang in there!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:55.730
Tarou!

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:57.430
Sara...

00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:00.760
You finally said my name.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.430
Just like in the past.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:06.670
Tarou, don't force yourself to talk if you're in pain!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.920
No. It's alright...

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:12.530
But more importantly, Sara,
 I have something to tell you.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:13.850
Tarou.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:15.520
I'm sorry, Sara.

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:18.450
I didn't want you to suffer this much.

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:23.490
But... when I found out that you were the Indian Ocean Mermaid Princess,

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:28.830
I felt that my existence would only trouble you, so I left.

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:32.630
Tarou.

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:35.660
He was only thinking for Sara's sake, so he left her.

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:37.630
I didn't know there was such a reason.

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.100
Sara.

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:41.510
Tarou-chan.

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:45.480
But, I didn't know that this would hurt you.

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.140
Sorry, Sara.

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:50.480
I hope that you can forgive me.

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:53.820
No, you don't have to forgive me.

00:17:53.820 --> 00:17:56.890
I just want you to promise me...

00:17:56.890 --> 00:18:01.280
...That you won't lose your identity as a Mermaid Princess.

00:18:03.900 --> 00:18:05.230
Tarou...

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:12.470
Sara's hair is...

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:17.240
The black feeling of hatred is disappearing from her heart.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:21.260
Her hatred was so deep that it changed the color of her hair.

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:24.350
It's because she bet everything on her love.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:27.150
That's why her hatred was so deep.

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:30.650
I understand that now, after having watched them.

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:33.990
Love couldn't bloom between us, no matter how hard I try.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:38.600
I wonder if I should give up on my feelings for Tarou-chan.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:40.260
Hanon.

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:45.570
Considering Tarou-chan's feelings, I feel that it's the best answer.

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:47.240
I can do that easily!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:53.910
Because I really liked Tarou...

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.500
I was truly in love with him!

00:18:58.310 --> 00:18:59.470
Hanon.

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:12.200
What was that tremor just now!?

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:13.860
What on earth was that!?

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:17.910
Gaito's final attack against the surface has started.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:18.650
Eh!?

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.440
What did you say!?

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:22.770
Everyone, I won't ask you to forgive me.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:25.450
But just give me one chance to atone for my sins.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:30.040
To make amends, I'll go and stop Gaito.

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:33.370
Even if I have to perish together with him.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:36.610
Sara.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:41.730
Gaito!

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:47.830
Kaito!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:51.270
Let's stop this foolishness, Gaito.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:54.370
Sara! So even you've betrayed me.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.270
Why did you do that?

00:19:57.010 --> 00:20:00.440
I wanted to fulfill your wishes, that's why I started all of this.

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:03.140
I beg you, Gaito! Please listen to me!

00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:08.150
Sara. You still have your Mermaid Princess friends.

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:11.060
But I don't have anyone.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.960
Now, even my only love has betrayed me.

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:17.190
Gaito.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.620
But I must thank you, Sara.

00:20:19.620 --> 00:20:22.810
Now I don't have any feelings that will hold me back.

00:20:23.510 --> 00:20:26.130
No one can stop me now!

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.940
Destroy! The whole world will be destroyed!

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:09.180
Kaito!

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:12.520
I beg you, Kaito! Please open your eyes!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:14.180
Kaito!

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.060
Someone's calling me.

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:24.370
Kaito! Kaito!

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:29.530
You're the mermaid from that time...

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:32.870
Kaito! Kaito!

00:21:35.990 --> 00:21:37.110
Lucia...

00:21:37.110 --> 00:21:41.040
Could it be... Lucia was that mermaid?

00:21:43.010 --> 00:21:44.260
Kaito!

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:48.390
Kaito!

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:50.620
Lucia!

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:02.820
Are you alright!?

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:04.200
Hey, hang in there!

00:22:04.200 --> 00:22:05.060
Hey!

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:09.210
Thank goodness you're safe...

00:22:09.440 --> 00:22:11.110
Hey, Lucia!

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:12.780
Lucia!

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:19.690
LUCIA!!!!!

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:53.540
I've finally realized it.

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:56.180
Lucia was the mermaid from that time.

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:58.750
I've let you suffer for a long time.

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.320
I don't have to hide my identity anymore, right!?

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:03.700
Kaito, I love you.

00:24:03.700 --> 00:24:04.600
Lucia.

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:07.120
I will fight for you.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:09.730
Against... against my older brother.

00:24:09.730 --> 00:24:12.130
We won't lose!

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:15.130
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:15.130 --> 00:24:16.250
The Last Kiss.

00:24:16.250 --> 00:24:20.210
Everyone, let's sing our melody!
